    <string name="steps_limitations">The phone sensor starts counting when you enable it, and steps taken before a phone restart that were not yet read can be lost. If VitQuest is not opened across midnight, those steps are split between the days by time. Health Connect shows only data that your phone or other apps write to it.</string>
